# CLAUDE.md

## Import Universal Rules
@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code Configuration

### Workflow Rules
- Do NOT auto-commit or push without explicit user confirmation
- When compacting, preserve the full list of modified files and design decisions made
- Before creating new files, check if a similar file already exists

### Model Preferences
- Use Sonnet for routine tasks (file edits, test writing, lint fixes)
- Use Opus for architecture decisions, complex debugging, and multi-file refactoring

### Forbidden Actions
- Do NOT modify files in [src/core/] without explicit approval
- Do NOT add `any` type in TypeScript or `# type: ignore` in Python
- Do NOT delete test files or reduce test coverage
- Do NOT install new dependencies without discussing the need first

### Compaction Instructions
When context is compacted, always preserve:
- List of all files modified in this session
- Any architecture or design decisions made
- Current task progress and remaining steps
